[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16151.03, "timestamp": "04:29:11", "text": "哦，不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16152.95, "timestamp": "04:29:12", "text": "我的天啊。等等，我动不了了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16156.389, "timestamp": "04:29:16", "text": "坚持，稍等。哥们，我没事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16159.429, "timestamp": "04:29:19", "text": "我会邀请你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16161.349, "timestamp": "04:29:21", "text": "你已受邀。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16163.189, "timestamp": "04:29:23", "text": "这感觉就像我上次主持节目的时候一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16165.349, "timestamp": "04:29:25", "text": "该死的，我能吗？你能吗？你能治好我吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16167.429, "timestamp": "04:29:27", "text": "少量？七天。七天是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16169.83, "timestamp": "04:29:29", "text": "糟糕的。康复。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16173.59, "timestamp": "04:29:33", "text": "好吧，如果你还有余力的话就来吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16175.269, "timestamp": "04:29:35", "text": "等等，严格来说，如果你跳进一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16177.83, "timestamp": "04:29:37", "text": "虫洞，你好像有点无聊了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16180.149, "timestamp": "04:29:40", "text": "说实话，这真的很有趣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16183.189, "timestamp": "04:29:43", "text": "哦，不错。我的客户表现很差。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16185.91, "timestamp": "04:29:45", "text": "如果我们没有落后，至少我是这么认为的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16187.51, "timestamp": "04:29:47", "text": "如果我网络延迟，你可以灭火"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16189.269, "timestamp": "04:29:49", "text": "比赛初期就用上了冰。啊，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16191.269, "timestamp": "04:29:51", "text": "好的。任天堂的账号太棒了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16193.99, "timestamp": "04:29:53", "text": "好的。好的。所以，没什么大不了的。"}]